1b:["$","p","1",{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":"Eligibility verification confirms that the patient's coverage is active on the date of service and that your practice is in network. It is done electronically in seconds through a clearinghouse or payer portal, and it should happen twice: at scheduling, and again at check-in, because coverage changes between the two."}]
